    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n66915" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεταρρυθμ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>change the form</i> or <i>fashion of</i> a thing,
